      en: ["Standing at approximately 5,700 meters, it is the highest point in Colombia.", "Located just 42 kilometers from the Caribbean coast.", "One of the few mountains in the world where you can see the ocean from a glacier.", "Sacred to the four indigenous groups of the Sierra Nevada de Santa Marta."]
